#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. off = the game's own picture: use it to compare. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = bordos limpos ao tamaño de renderizado do xogo. DLSS = o mesmo, e escala cando a Escala do "
"xogo é inferior ao 100 %. desactivado = a imaxe propia do xogo, para comparar. Gárdase ao "
"instante."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your GPU. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, half-size see-through "
"depth, flat mirrors without part motion, lighter part-motion search. low = also no mirror DLAA, "
"no see-through depth, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Perfís para a túa GPU. alto = todo activado (modelo 1). medio = modelo 2, profundidade "
"transparente a media resolución, retrovisores planos sen movemento de pezas, busca de movemento "
"máis lixeira. baixo = tamén sen DLAA nos retrovisores, sen profundidade transparente, área VR 60 "
"%. Nunca cambia o que axustaches."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, least ghosting "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = máis detalle, texto máis nítido, uns 1,6x a GPU do 2. 2 (E) = equilibrado, menos rastro "
"detrás do tráfico: empeza aquí. 3 (F) = máis calmo en valados e cables, pode borrar detalle en "
"movemento, mesmo custo que o 2. 4 (M) = o máis pesado (uns 5x), só para probas en pantalla plana."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the DLAA area and the see-through depth. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Calidade de imaxe: nitidez, nitidez de textura, área do DLAA e profundidade transparente. Dereita "
"abre o grupo, Esquerda péchao; comeza pechado cada vez que se abre o menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Aumenta a nitidez despois do DLAA, de 0 (desactivado) a 1,0. Súbea se a imaxe se ve suave; moi "
"alto fai halos claros nos bordos. Custa uns 0,1 ms; 0 sáltase o paso."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Alcance da nitidez, de 1 a 4 px: pequeno = detalle fino, grande = bordos máis marcados. Cámbiao "
"se a nitidez parece demasiado fina ou grosa; unha imaxe maior ca a pantalla, como en VR, precisa "
"máis de 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. No GPU time, only a little memory bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"Texto de textura máis nítido (sinais, panel, GPS). 0 = desactivado; máis negativo = máis nítido "
"pero máis cintilación en valados; proba -0,5 a -1 se o texto se ve borroso. Sen custo de GPU, só "
"un pouco de largura de banda."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaf cut-outs: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it "
"if grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Acts only while Texture sharpness is not 0. No "
"GPU time, a little memory."
msgstr ""
"O mesmo para valados de arame, herba e recortes de follas: sube cara a 0 se os valados cintilan, "
"baixa se a herba se ve suave. igual = segue a fila de enriba. Só actúa se a Nitidez de textura "
"non é 0. Sen custo de GPU."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: só o centro de cada ollo recibe DLAA (20 a 100 %); o bordo mantén a imaxe do xogo. Baixa para "
"permitir un modelo máis pesado ou gañar fps; 40 % custa uns 40 % do modelo. Tamén fixa o camión "
"do garaxe / menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA before the game's bloom / tonemap, so lane paint, wires and rails shimmer less. "
"Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscale or Windows HDR. Same cost either way; takes "
"~60 frames to switch."
msgstr ""
"Só pantalla plana: DLAA antes do bloom / tonemap do xogo, para que liñas, cables e carrís "
"cintilen menos. Cámbiao só para comparar. Non vale con upscale DLSS nin HDR de Windows. Mesmo "
"custo; tarda ~60 fotogramas en cambiar."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives wires, fences and glass their own distance instead of what is behind them, so they do not "
"smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Dálle a cables, valados e vidros a súa propia distancia en vez da do fondo, para que non se "
"borren ao moverte. Desactiva se non ves borrado: aforra 0,02 - 0,06 ms por ollo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: DLSS takes each "
"glow from the current frame, not its history. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp glows flicker, 0 = "
"off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Evita que o brillo de farois e luces de coche deixe rastro ao moverte: o DLSS toma cada brillo do "
"fotograma actual, non do historial. Pasos do 25 %; baixa se os brillos cintilan, 0 = desactivado. "
"Custa uns 0,05 - 0,2 ms por ollo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Como o DLAA trata as pezas en movemento e os retrovisores do camión. Dereita abre o grupo, "
"Esquerda péchao; comeza pechado cada vez que se abre o menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives each moving part (traffic, wheels, plates) its own motion for DLAA, so it stays sharp and "
"does not ghost. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: every pixel then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"Dálle a cada peza móbil (tráfico, rodas, matrículas) o seu propio movemento para o DLAA, para que "
"quede nítida e sen rastro. Desactiva só para aforrar uns 0,5 ms por ollo ou probar: cada píxel "
"segue a cámara e o tráfico bórrase."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives truck mirrors their own DLAA so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can ghost "
"in the glass; else each part moves exactly in the glass."
msgstr ""
"Dálle aos retrovisores o seu propio DLAA para que non cintilen. 1 retrovisor = só o maior (o "
"principal ao teu lado). todos = cada retrovisor. cámara = máis barato por espello, o tráfico pode "
"deixar rastro no vidro; se non, cada peza móvese ben no vidro."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"activado = cada retrovisor recibe o DLAA cada 2 fotogramas e mostra a última imaxe limpa entre "
"medias: uns a metade do custo. Bordos limpos; o que se move no vidro actualízase a media taxa. "
"desactivado = cada retrovisor en cada fotograma."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires keep their motion while you drive: DLAA spreads the motion data over thin lines (DLSS "
"motion dilation). on = default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is "
"soft for a moment when it changes."
msgstr ""
"Os cables finos manteñen o movemento mentres conduces: o DLAA espalla os datos de movemento polas "
"liñas finas (dilatación de movemento do DLSS). activado = predeterminado. desactivado = só para "
"comparar; os cables próximos cintilan máis. A imaxe vese suave un momento ao cambiar."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires get depth on every pixel they touch, not only where they cover a pixel centre. on = "
"default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Os cables finos reciben profundidade en cada píxel que tocan, non só onde cobren o centro do "
"píxel. activado = predeterminado. activado (no A2C) = tamén en bordos transparentes. desactivado "
"= só para comparar; os cables próximos cintilan máis."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Experimental: debuxa os cables afastados máis finos ca 1 píxel como liña de 1 píxel, para que non "
"se rompan en trazos. Desactivado por defecto: os cables afastados poden verse máis escuros ou "
"cintilar máis. Proba e compara."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS upscale, the DLAA on / off switch and the OFXR Bridge / VectorXR info. Right opens the "
"group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Upscale DLSS, o interruptor de acender / apagar o DLAA e a info do OFXR Bridge / VectorXR. "
"Dereita abre o grupo, Esquerda péchao; comeza pechado cada vez que se abre o menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS draws the picture back up to full size when the game's Scaling is below 100 %: sharper than "
"the game's own stretch, and fewer pixels drawn means more fps. No extra cost; does nothing at "
"Scaling 100 %."
msgstr ""
"O DLSS redebuxa a imaxe a tamaño completo cando a Escala do xogo é inferior ao 100 %: máis nítido "
"ca o estirado do xogo, e menos píxeles significan máis fps. Sen custo extra; non fai nada con "
"Escala 100 %."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Acende ou apaga todo o mod e garda o modo; desactivado mostra a imaxe do xogo, para comparar. "
"Desactivado aforra o custo de todas as partes xuntas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = xeración de fotogramas en VR de djules75, descarga á parte "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). atopado = a súa capa está cargada neste xogo e o mod deixa "
"pasar o seu traballo. Inicia a súa app da bandexa antes do xogo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = un conxunto de melloras OpenXR de DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"profundidade, xeración de fotogramas; atopado = a súa capa está cargada no xogo e o mod deixa "
"pasar o seu traballo. Usa só un Turbo (o seu ou o do mod)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering and the hidden area mask. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Aceleracións VR: Turbo, renderizado foveado e a máscara de área oculta. Dereita abre o grupo, "
"Esquerda péchao; comeza pechado cada vez que se abre o menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo: no ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojection. VR only. On = the game stops waiting for "
"the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy cities, traffic). Turn it "
"off if the picture judders. From OpenXR Toolkit."
msgstr ""
"Turbo: sen ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reproxección. Só VR. Activado = o xogo deixa de esperar "
"polo visor en cada fotograma: máis fps só cando a CPU é o límite (cidades cheas, tráfico). "
"Desactiva se a imaxe vai a trompicóns. Do OpenXR Toolkit."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring is shaded once per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Centro nítido, menos detalle no bordo (só NVIDIA RTX). Aforra GPU con Escala alta. Só VR. O anel "
"exterior sombréase unha vez por 2 x 2 píxeles; valados, herba e follas manteñen o detalle. "
"Desactiva se o bordo se ve a bloques."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the view "
"sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Tamaño do centro nítido do Foveated (VRS), 10 - 100 % en pasos de 5 %: máis grande = máis vista "
"nítida, menos aforro; máis pequeno = máis aforro, menos detalle preto do medio. 80 % "
"(equilibrado) é o predeterminado; 90 = ancho, 65 = estreito."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's passes Foveated (VRS) acts on. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + "
"lighting = also the game's lighting pass, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for "
"blocky light or shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"En que pasos do xogo actúa o Foveated (VRS). escena = só o mundo 3D (predeterminado). escena + "
"iluminación = tamén a iluminación, só no bordo extremo: máis aforro. Proba: busca bordos de luz "
"ou sombra a bloques nos lados da vista."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated (VRS) is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Canto de groso é o anel exterior do Foveated (VRS). Normal = 1 cor por 2 x 2 píxeles "
"(predeterminado). Forte = por 4 x 2, Máx = por 4 x 4: máis aforro de GPU, bordos a bloques. "
"Mellor con eye tracking, onde nunca miras o anel exterior."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) follows your eyes on a headset with eye tracking "
"(OpenXR eye gaze, for example Varjo); without one it stays at the lens centre. Needs Foveated "
"(VRS) on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Experimental. O centro nítido do Foveated (VRS) segue os teus ollos nun visor con eye tracking "
"(mirada OpenXR, p. ex. Varjo); sen el queda no centro da lente. Precisa o Foveated (VRS) activado "
"ao iniciar o xogo, se non reinicia. Case sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Só VR. O xogo sáltase os cantos da lente que nunca ves (o visor infórmaos), debuxa menos píxeles: "
"máis marxe de GPU, a imaxe que ves é a mesma. A primeira activación require reiniciar o xogo. "
"Desactiva se o bordo da vista se ve raro."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate limits and CPU: NVIDIA Reflex and an FPS cap for flat, a VR FPS cap, CPU tuning. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Límites de taxa de fotogramas e CPU: NVIDIA Reflex e límite de FPS para pantalla plana, límite de "
"FPS VR, axuste da CPU. Dereita abre o grupo, Esquerda péchao; comeza pechado cada vez que se abre "
"o menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only. On = the game's frames wait less in the GPU queue: less input lag when "
"the GPU is the limit. Boost also keeps the GPU clocks up. Same fps; small cost. Not used in VR."
msgstr ""
"Só pantalla plana, só NVIDIA. Activado = os fotogramas do xogo esperan menos na cola da GPU: "
"menos input lag cando a GPU é o límite. Boost mantén tamén altos os reloxos da GPU. Mesmos fps; "
"custo pequeno. Non se usa en VR."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Reflex on, the NVIDIA driver does the "
"limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Só pantalla plana. Limita o xogo como máximo a esta taxa: tempo de fotograma estable, menos calor "
"e consumo. Pónao un pouco por baixo do que o teu PC aguanta nunha cidade chea. Con Reflex "
"activado, limita o controlador NVIDIA. desactivado = sen límite."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's reprojection (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it when "
"the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Só VR. metade = o xogo debuxa 1 de cada 2 fotogramas do visor (72 Hz -> 36 fps), terzo = 1 de "
"cada 3; a reproxección do visor (ASW / Motion Smoothing) enche o resto a ritmo estable. Úsao se "
"os fps oscilan. Desactiva o Turbo mentres está activo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together: the main and render thread prefer the P-cores (Intel hybrid CPUs "
"only), the game runs at Above normal priority, and Windows may not throttle it (EcoQoS) or ignore "
"its timer requests. Helps when the CPU is the limit; no cost. Separate settings in dlaa.ini: "
"cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Tres axustes de CPU xuntos: os fíos principal e de render prefiren os P-cores (só CPUs híbridas "
"Intel), o xogo corre con prioridade Por riba do normal, e Windows non o pode limitar (EcoQoS) nin "
"ignorar os seus temporizadores. Axuda se a CPU é o límite; sen custo. Axustes separados no "
"dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Posición, tamaño, profundidade e orientación do panel, e as teclas do menú. Dereita abre o grupo, "
"Esquerda péchao; comeza pechado cada vez que se abre o menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Só VR. Seguir a cabeza = o panel segue o visor. Fixo na cabina = queda nun punto diante do teu "
"asento, estable cando miras arredor; X / Y / profundidade fixan ese punto (graos, metros). "
"Precisa a capa VR (predeterminado). Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Move este panel de lado, en % da pantalla (VR fixo na cabina: graos arredor do asento). Pantalla "
"plana e VR gardan cada un a súa posición. Úsao se o panel tapa algo que necesitas. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Move este panel arriba / abaixo, en % da pantalla (VR fixo na cabina: graos, máis = abaixo). "
"Pantalla plana e VR gardan cada un a súa posición. Úsao se o panel tapa algo que necesitas. Sen "
"custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Fai este panel máis grande ou máis pequeno. Sube se non podes lelo, baixa se tapa demasiado. "
"Pantalla plana e VR gardan cada un o seu tamaño. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Só VR, en gris en pantalla plana. A que distancia flota o panel: en metros (0,30 - 3,00) como "
"capa VR, o predeterminado; en px de desprazamento por ollo con menu_vr_layer = 0. Mesmo tamaño a "
"calquera profundidade. Cámbiao se cansa mirar. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Só VR, en gris en pantalla plana. Activado = o panel xírase cara a ti cando o moves de lado, "
"mesmo tamaño desde calquera ángulo (como capa VR, o predeterminado, tamén a caixa de fps que "
"segue a cabeza); desactivado = imaxe plana. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR). Use it to see "
"what a setting gains. Its GPU cost is measured: per frame, every picture it is drawn into; none "
"when off. Save keeps it for the next start."
msgstr ""
"Unha pequena caixa de fps e tempo de fotograma en directo, tamén co menú pechado (plano e VR). "
"Úsaa para ver canto gaña un axuste. O custo de GPU mídese: por fotograma, cada imaxe onde se "
"debuxa; ningún en desactivado. Gardar consérvaa para o próximo inicio."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Fixación, posición, tamaño, cor, distancia VR e xiro da caixa de fps. Dereita abre o grupo, "
"Esquerda péchao; comeza pechado cada vez que se abre o menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + "
"Per-part motion vectors). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Só VR. Seguir a cabeza = segue o visor. Fixo na área de xogo = un punto arredor do asento, ignora "
"o balance da cabina. Pegado ao vehículo = pegado á cabina, balancéase con ela (precisa DLAA + "
"vectores de movemento por peza). Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR, só Pegado ao vehículo. Activado = cada camión / coche garda o sitio da súa caixa de fps na "
"cabina, xiro, tamaño, cor, brillo e texto (gárdase no dlaa.ini ao pechar o menú). Desactivado = "
"un só conxunto para todos os vehículos. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"VR, só Pegado ao vehículo. Dereita = medir a cabina de novo agora (quieto, aparcado) se a caixa "
"queda fóra de sitio. Esquerda = a caixa deste vehículo volve ao predeterminado (sitio, xiro, "
"tamaño, cor, texto); os outros vehículos manteñen a súa. A caixa queda recta coa cabina."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Move a caixa de fps de lado, en % da pantalla (VR fixo / pegado: graos arredor de ti). Pantalla "
"plana e VR gardan cada un a súa posición. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Move a caixa de fps arriba / abaixo, en % da pantalla (VR fixo / pegado: graos, menos = arriba). "
"Pantalla plana e VR gardan cada un a súa posición. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Só VR, en gris en pantalla plana. Xira a caixa de fps á esquerda / dereita, en graos (+ = a cara "
"xira á dereita). Úsao para orientar a caixa cando está de lado. 0 = mira cara a ti. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Só VR, en gris en pantalla plana. Inclina a caixa de fps, en graos (+ = a parte de arriba "
"afástase de ti, coma deitada no panel). 0 = mira cara a ti. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Só VR, en gris en pantalla plana. Xira a caixa de fps no seu propio plano, en graos (+ = sentido "
"horario). 0 = dereita. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Fai a caixa de fps máis grande ou máis pequena (0,2 .. 3,0). Sube se non podes lela no visor ou "
"nunha pantalla grande. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"A cor do texto da caixa de fps: 20 cores, cada unha con contorno para lerse sobre calquera imaxe "
"(negro sobre branco = texto escuro, contorno branco). Plano e VR. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Brillo da caixa de fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = a cor tal cal, menos escurece o texto (o contorno "
"queda) cara ao negro. Úsao para baixar o contador de noite ou no visor. Plano e VR. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Canto de transparente é toda a caixa de fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = sólida, menos esvaece o texto E o "
"seu contorno negro xuntos, para que non quede unha mancha negra. Plano e VR. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Só VR, en gris en pantalla plana. A que distancia flota a caixa de fps, 0,30 - 3,00 m. Mantén o "
"mesmo tamaño na vista a calquera distancia; só cambia a profundidade. Ponla preto da profundidade "
"onde miras para lela sen reenfocar. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics, and debug also runs "
"the GPU timers and the CPU profiler."
msgstr ""
"Que vai ao dlaa_inject.log: desactivado = nada; erros = só fallos (predeterminado); avisos = + "
"problemas sorteados; info = + inicio e cambios; debug = + estatísticas, e debug tamén activa os "
"temporizadores da GPU e o profiler da CPU."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"O idioma deste menú. auto = o idioma do xogo (predeterminado); Esquerda / Dereita escolle outro. "
"Linux / Proton: chinés, xaponés e coreano precisan as súas fontes instaladas, mira o README. Un "
"ficheiro lang\\<code>.po á beira da DLL ten prioridade, para as túas correccións. Gardar "
"consérvao. Sen custo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Todos os atallos deste menú, unha liña por acción, coa tecla do teclado e o botón do mando. "
"Dereita abre a lista; escolle unha acción con Dereita e preme a nova tecla ou botón do volante. "
"Gárdase no dlaa.ini ao instante."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Escribe todo o que se ve aquí no dlaa.ini (axustes, e as posicións do panel / caixa de fps unha "
"vez movidas), mantendo as outras liñas. Fai isto cando che guste o resultado, ou os cambios "
"perdense no próximo inicio. O modo gárdase só."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, profile, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, logging), live "
"and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Volve todos os axustes deste menú ao que trae o mod (modelo, nitidez, nitidez de textura, área "
"DLAA, movemento, retrovisores, perfil, panel, caixa de fps, turbo, foveated, taxa de fotogramas, "
"rexistro), en directo e no dlaa.ini, mantendo os teus atallos e as outras liñas."

